From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mihawk <163614687+mihawk-99@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 07:20:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] radv/ps5: the console's GPU, GFX1013 with AGC's rings

From mihawk-99/PS5_Mesa, squashed:

  c801d0ee5f3 radv: host image copy follows the swizzles, not the GFX level
  c6f7cd8c72c radv/ps5: tessellation through AGC's factor ring; no NGG culling
  d06cb387ac3 radv/ps5: no integer dot-product instructions
  be96316fa5a radv/ps5: AGC's off-chip parameter; no legacy geometry shaders
  fb301d92c1f radv/ps5: keep separately compiled geometry shader objects on NGG
  65659b7f623 amd/addrlib: copy by microblock only where a microblock is 256 contiguous bytes
  64f2d2a04a7 radv: host image copy on GFX10
  e181b948876 radv/ps5: the GPU has GFX1013's TC-compatible HTILE clear bug
  05839d9141d radv/ps5: no device-generated commands
